summary:
  The place the reader is seen at may move back to the file's start.

history:
  Between the open and the seek to the park the player stands at 0 and
  already says it plays. A tick in that moment would note 0 as the place
  heard, and an end that names no place would reopen the buffer at its
  start: the station from the moment it was put on.

target:
  package/contents/ui/TimeshiftEngine.qml

find:
          _heardPosMs = Math.max(_heardPosMs,

replace:
          _heardPosMs = (

expect:
  Killed by tst_timeshiftengine::test_the_place_seen_before_the_seek_landed_is_not_the_listeners.
  Line-neutral.
